      "updated": 1770656242882,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "inputData: {\n    categories: string[]\n    value: string | null\n}\n\noutputData: string | null \n\nstate: {\n    currentExisting = string_category | null\n    currentNew = string | null\n    displayMode = 'existing' | 'new'\n}\n\n\n- if categories = [], show 'Create New'. When switching\nto 'Existing', placeholder text is 'No categories found'\n- if categories doesn't include value, show 'Create New'\npopulated with 'value'\n- if categories includes entered new value, set this\noptions in existingCategories\n",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "inputData: {\n    categories: string[]\n    value: string | null\n}\n\noutputData: string | null \n\nstate: {\n    currentExisting = string_category | null\n    currentNew = string | null\n    displayMode = 'existing' | 'new'\n}\n\n\n- if categories = [], show 'Create New'. When switching to 'Existing', placeholder text is 'No categories found'\n- if categories doesn't include value, show 'Create New' populated with 'value'\n- if categories includes entered new value, set this options in existingCategories\n",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
